{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089530/extras/e587f0fe0983b542215a5d2d307f2dac.avif?t=1759890740\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kiefer. K, a freelance journalist investigating a secret government facility near the town of Rushworth, Australia. Shortly after arriving things take a turn for the worst and you'll be forced into a battle of survival. Can you discover the secrets of the facility and escape to tell the story?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PARAWYRM</i> is a first person action/<i>horror game\u00a0</i>created by <i>M. Lang</i> and is inspired by titles like <i> Half-Life and Doom.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F E A T U R E S</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Atmospheric &amp; immersive environments to explore based on Rural Australian Bushland &amp; more.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Progression System</i></strong><i>:  Spend Token's collected from fallen foes and hidden in the environment to improve a variety of skills!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wield an arsenal of unique weapons!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battle a large roster of different enemies both Human and Demonic!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collectables!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lite puzzles!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Exploration!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pixelated retro aesthetic!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Created by one man with a dream o7</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089530/extras/1c80